WEBVTT

01:58.000 --> 01:59.560
If you don't believe me, Yiren,

01:59.560 --> 02:01.480
just kill me with your sword.

02:02.480 --> 02:03.710
Yiren, I only ask

02:04.510 --> 02:05.440
that after I die,

02:06.310 --> 02:08.370
don't trust Xiao Qiushui so readily.

02:08.560 --> 02:11.760
He's already lost the fighting spirit
of our Xiao family.

02:19.520 --> 02:20.920
My final request, Yiren,

02:22.030 --> 02:23.960
is for you to destroy the Power Gang

02:24.079 --> 02:25.280
and kill Li Chenzhou

02:26.079 --> 02:26.940
and Liu Suifeng

02:27.520 --> 02:28.780
to avenge our parents.

02:48.150 --> 02:48.800
Why?

02:52.520 --> 02:54.750
I don't even know who to trust anymore.

02:56.240 --> 02:58.310
You've both changed completely.

02:58.630 --> 03:00.430
I'm the only one kept in the dark.

03:02.150 --> 03:03.480
I worked in the shadows,

03:06.000 --> 03:08.060
while you were in plain sight, Yiren.

03:09.240 --> 03:11.150
You endured all those humiliations

03:11.150 --> 03:12.870
for my sake.

03:14.280 --> 03:14.870
Yiren,

03:16.120 --> 03:18.250
if you truly don't know who to believe,

03:19.310 --> 03:22.040
go back to our villa in Jindu
and see for yourself.

03:22.240 --> 03:25.560
You accomplished something significant
for His Majesty, Yiren,

03:25.560 --> 03:28.290
and our Xiao family has received
imperial favor.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.280
It'll be clear to you right away

03:29.280 --> 03:31.310
who's truly working for

03:33.400 --> 03:35.460
our Xiao family's interests, Yiren.

03:56.310 --> 03:56.870
Father,

03:58.120 --> 03:58.590
Mother.

03:59.910 --> 04:01.640
Your unfilial son, Xiao Yiren,

04:02.870 --> 04:03.960
has come to see you.

04:45.120 --> 04:45.720
Father,

04:46.720 --> 04:47.310
Mother.

04:49.600 --> 04:50.600
I'm unfilial,

04:51.800 --> 04:54.200
but I can only try to restore
the Xiao family

04:54.310 --> 04:55.510
in my own way.

04:57.510 --> 04:59.120
I hope, in the realm beyond,

05:01.270 --> 05:03.470
you'll not hold my weakness against me.

05:19.160 --> 05:20.360
Qiushui!

05:21.680 --> 05:23.010
Come on, check this out!

05:26.240 --> 05:26.720
Look!

05:28.800 --> 05:30.800
The Shaolin, Wudang, and Emei sects

05:31.120 --> 05:33.270
have jointly announced
a Heroes' Gathering

05:33.270 --> 05:36.600
to select a Martial Arts Alliance Leader
at Changban Slope.

05:40.000 --> 05:41.159
The position of the Alliance Leader

05:41.159 --> 05:43.090
hasn't been filled for many years.

05:43.480 --> 05:45.210
It seems these martial artists

05:45.870 --> 05:48.130
have learned about the imperial decree,

05:48.510 --> 05:50.270
and they want to select an alliance leader

05:50.270 --> 05:52.870
to lead the entire martial world
in protecting General Wu.

05:52.870 --> 05:53.930
The purpose of this

05:54.510 --> 05:57.040
is to jointly resist
the Northern Wasteland.

05:57.630 --> 05:59.870
The Power Gang
and the Long River waterways

05:59.870 --> 06:01.200
will certainly attend.

06:01.630 --> 06:02.920
I think this time...

06:03.000 --> 06:06.000
If Xiao Kaiyan claims
the title of alliance leader

06:06.360 --> 06:08.420
under the guise of Zhu the Great King,

06:08.870 --> 06:09.720
General Wu

06:11.630 --> 06:12.830
may well be in danger.

06:13.830 --> 06:14.630
Qiushui,

06:15.270 --> 06:18.720
are you going to attend
the Martial Arts Tournament?

06:21.070 --> 06:21.750
I must go.

06:22.720 --> 06:26.560
I'll expose Xiao Kaiyan's true face
in front of everyone.

06:30.240 --> 06:31.070
But the internal energies

06:31.070 --> 06:31.920
of the Eight Masters inside your body

06:31.920 --> 06:33.380
haven't fully merged yet.

06:33.600 --> 06:34.720
Forcing it down now

06:34.870 --> 06:36.530
will surely damage your body.

06:36.600 --> 06:37.510
Besides, Kaiyan

06:37.510 --> 06:39.110
has used the Voidheart Codex

06:39.240 --> 06:42.100
to steal martial skills
from many martial masters.

06:42.480 --> 06:44.390
Are you really confident?

06:45.120 --> 06:45.850
Don't worry.

06:47.430 --> 06:48.290
No matter what,

06:49.120 --> 06:50.000
even if I die,

06:51.000 --> 06:52.530
I won't let him have his way.

06:54.630 --> 06:55.270
Qiushui,

06:55.920 --> 06:56.850
I believe in you.

06:57.800 --> 06:59.530
This Martial Arts Tournament—

06:59.830 --> 07:01.490
who else but you could lead it?

07:01.870 --> 07:02.510
Well said!

07:04.240 --> 07:04.840
Well said!

07:05.160 --> 07:06.040
-Fifth Thug!
-Big Brother!

07:06.040 --> 07:07.070
Fifth Thug, we're here!

07:07.070 --> 07:08.270
-Fifth Thug!
-Fifth Thug!

07:08.270 --> 07:09.000
Big Brother!

07:09.720 --> 07:10.380
We're here!

07:11.070 --> 07:11.600
You guys!

07:12.040 --> 07:13.270
-Qiushui.
-Big Brother.

07:13.270 --> 07:14.470
We believe in you too.

07:17.360 --> 07:18.000
Yuhan.

07:19.680 --> 07:21.010
Your family affairs...

07:22.240 --> 07:24.100
Everything's been taken care of.

07:24.160 --> 07:24.890
Big Brother.

07:25.270 --> 07:27.870
At such an important moment
when you're running for

07:27.870 --> 07:29.720
the Martial Arts Alliance Leader,
how could I possibly be absent?

07:29.720 --> 07:30.520
That's right.

07:30.800 --> 07:32.070
I've already sent word home,

07:32.070 --> 07:33.000
telling them to wait patiently

07:33.000 --> 07:35.730
for our Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood's
good news.

07:35.830 --> 07:37.720
We Four Thugs
can't miss out on something like this!

07:37.720 --> 07:39.270
That's right,
can't do without the Four Thugs!

07:39.270 --> 07:40.720
Can't do without us!

07:41.120 --> 07:43.830
Fifth Thug! We're essential!

07:44.480 --> 07:45.810
Absolutely essential!

07:46.270 --> 07:47.040
In my life,

07:48.630 --> 07:49.870
I hold the greatest respect for

07:49.870 --> 07:53.400
those who are benevolent, righteous,
loyal, and trustworthy.

07:54.510 --> 07:55.600
With your support,

07:56.630 --> 07:57.560
I, Xiao Qiushui,

08:00.040 --> 08:01.160
thank you all.

08:02.120 --> 08:03.720
It should be us thanking you.

08:04.040 --> 08:06.070
If you hadn't let us join
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood,

08:06.070 --> 08:06.800
we'd still be

08:07.070 --> 08:08.800
wandering aimlessly somewhere.

08:08.800 --> 08:09.510
Yes, exactly!

08:09.510 --> 08:11.040
I wouldn't know where I'd be now.

08:11.040 --> 08:11.920
-Well said!
-That's right!

08:11.920 --> 08:12.560
Qiushui,

08:12.720 --> 08:14.160
we're all like sworn brothers,

08:14.160 --> 08:15.360
so there's no need for formalities.

08:15.360 --> 08:17.270
Right, no formalities!

08:17.600 --> 08:18.720
No need for formalities.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.870
That's right.

08:20.040 --> 08:21.600
Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood!

08:21.600 --> 08:23.120
United by righteousness!

08:24.870 --> 08:26.330
United by righteousness!

08:31.270 --> 08:33.000
Today's Martial Arts Tournament

08:33.000 --> 08:35.530
brings together heroes
from all over the land

08:35.750 --> 08:38.909
is to determine the greatest
martial artist of the Central Plains.

08:38.909 --> 08:41.030
The winner will be granted
the Alliance Leader's token

08:41.030 --> 08:42.559
and lead the martial heroes

08:42.960 --> 08:44.750
in rescuing General Wu.

08:45.270 --> 08:47.910
Anyone who is not guilty of
unforgivable crimes, debauchery,

08:47.910 --> 08:49.200
or betrayal of Daxi

08:49.720 --> 08:51.720
may participate in the competition.

08:51.720 --> 08:53.240
The competition will be a tournament,

08:53.240 --> 08:54.570
with one-on-one duels.

08:54.630 --> 08:57.440
The final winner
will proceed to Canghai Pavilion,

08:57.440 --> 09:00.840
where, under the witness of
the Shaolin, Wudang, and Emei sects,

09:00.840 --> 09:03.640
they'll be bestowed
the Alliance Leader's title.

10:26.600 --> 10:27.330
As expected,

10:28.000 --> 10:30.720
the Alliance Leader will be decided
between you and me.

10:30.720 --> 10:33.920
Aren't the Long River waterways
enough for you to manage?

10:34.270 --> 10:36.720
Coming to snatch
the position of Alliance Leader,

10:36.720 --> 10:38.650
surely you have ulterior motives.

10:40.270 --> 10:42.150
To be able to compete with you

10:42.510 --> 10:44.600
in front of the heroes
from across the land

10:44.600 --> 10:45.270
is worth it.

10:48.240 --> 10:49.840
You are truly hypocritical.

10:51.720 --> 10:53.320
Since we can't see eye to eye,

10:53.440 --> 10:54.720
let's just start fighting.

10:54.720 --> 10:55.240
Wait!

11:04.200 --> 11:05.080
Xiao Yiren?

11:05.750 --> 11:07.030
Why is Qiushui's eldest brother here?

11:07.030 --> 11:07.830
Why is he here?

11:11.600 --> 11:12.200
Yiren.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.900
Don't call me that.

11:15.720 --> 11:17.780
You're not yet qualified to fight me.

11:18.030 --> 11:20.960
Defeat your elder brother first,
and then we'll see.

11:25.200 --> 11:25.750
Yiren.

11:27.720 --> 11:31.080
You really choose to trust him?

11:31.750 --> 11:32.720
Enough talk.

11:52.360 --> 11:53.220
Make your move!

12:06.670 --> 12:07.270
This...

13:20.600 --> 13:21.860
No matter where we are,

13:22.030 --> 13:23.690
you're always such a handful.

13:23.910 --> 13:25.370
Are you done with your act?

13:30.240 --> 13:32.040
Don't forget who you really are.

14:54.720 --> 14:55.630
-Second Young Master Xiao?
-Xiao Kaiyan?

14:55.630 --> 14:56.720
It's actually Xiao Kaiyan.

14:56.720 --> 14:58.120
This is the second son
of the Xiao family, right?

14:58.120 --> 14:59.000
Xiao Kaiyan?

14:59.320 --> 15:01.180
Why is he here? How could it be him?

15:09.630 --> 15:10.240
Yiren?

15:13.630 --> 15:14.690
You want to kill me?

15:15.720 --> 15:16.750
By killing you,

15:18.120 --> 15:19.630
I can avenge our parents.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.000
Xiao Yiren!

15:26.720 --> 15:27.850
For Qiushui's sake,

15:29.240 --> 15:31.100
you're actually going to kill me?

15:35.670 --> 15:38.360
Why do you always take his side?

15:40.840 --> 15:42.240
Our parents did,

15:45.480 --> 15:47.120
and now you do too.

16:02.870 --> 16:03.910
Just die!

16:07.120 --> 16:07.920
Young Master!

16:11.910 --> 16:12.960
Yiren!

16:33.670 --> 16:34.320
Yiren.

16:35.270 --> 16:35.750
Young Master!

16:35.750 --> 16:36.510
-Yiren!
-Young Master!

16:36.510 --> 16:36.910
Young Master!

16:36.910 --> 16:39.310
Zhu the Great King is actually
Xiao Kaiyan?

16:39.320 --> 16:40.050
Xiao Kaiyan!

16:40.510 --> 16:41.360
Yes, indeed.

16:41.840 --> 16:43.100
What's this all about?

16:49.080 --> 16:50.550
I'm Zhu the Great King.

16:51.910 --> 16:53.440
I'm also Xiao Kaiyan.

16:57.600 --> 16:58.360
Xiao Kaiyan!

16:58.360 --> 16:59.630
So where is Zhu the Great King?

16:59.630 --> 17:01.160
Where is Zhu the Great King?

17:02.200 --> 17:03.730
Are you trying to betray me?

17:09.640 --> 17:10.640
Xiao Qiushui.

17:13.510 --> 17:14.589
At this point,

17:17.400 --> 17:19.060
what can you possibly do to me?

17:21.109 --> 17:21.880
Your heart

17:23.440 --> 17:24.680
is truly merciless.

17:44.880 --> 17:45.510
Qiushui.

17:48.510 --> 17:49.200
Yiren!

17:58.750 --> 17:59.810
-This...
-This...

17:59.920 --> 18:00.480
Let's go.

18:00.680 --> 18:01.550
We should go.

18:06.680 --> 18:07.240
Yiren.

18:13.510 --> 18:14.110
Yiren.

18:19.070 --> 18:19.720
Qiushui.

18:21.310 --> 18:22.110
It's alright.

18:23.920 --> 18:25.320
That palm strike just now

18:26.550 --> 18:27.680
was owed to you.

18:31.270 --> 18:33.530
I don't deserve to be your elder brother.

18:34.720 --> 18:36.380
I was deceived by too many lies

18:37.830 --> 18:38.830
and brought shame

18:39.550 --> 18:40.610
to the Xiao family.

18:45.510 --> 18:46.110
Yiren.

18:48.000 --> 18:50.060
What nonsense are you talking about?

18:50.310 --> 18:51.510
Don't talk anymore.

18:52.750 --> 18:54.070
I need you to live.

18:57.510 --> 18:58.350
Qiushui.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.350
It's my fault,

19:02.510 --> 19:03.720
entirely my fault.

19:04.750 --> 19:07.440
There were signs all along,

19:09.270 --> 19:11.310
yet I never noticed.

19:14.200 --> 19:15.070
I've failed

19:16.310 --> 19:18.240
our parents.

19:23.070 --> 19:23.680
Yiren.

19:25.400 --> 19:27.640
I'll channel my energy to heal you
right now.

19:27.640 --> 19:28.840
Please stop talking.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.240
No.

19:34.640 --> 19:35.770
That strike just now

19:37.110 --> 19:38.840
has severed my heart meridian.

19:42.550 --> 19:43.680
This is for the best.

19:45.830 --> 19:47.070
I'll no longer

19:48.680 --> 19:50.400
have to live in shame anymore.

19:53.400 --> 19:54.920
Q-Qiushui.

19:56.720 --> 19:58.320
From now on, the Huanhua Sect

19:59.680 --> 20:01.160
depends on you.

20:13.720 --> 20:14.590
Qiushui.

20:16.720 --> 20:19.200
Bury me beside Huanhua Stream,

20:20.070 --> 20:22.790
on a hill where I can see the Sword Manor.

20:23.310 --> 20:25.310
I don't deserve to be buried inside.

20:25.550 --> 20:26.750
Just bury me outside,

20:28.440 --> 20:30.370
watching over the Xiao Residence.

20:58.680 --> 20:59.310
Yiren...

21:03.240 --> 21:03.960
Yiren.

21:09.510 --> 21:10.240
Yiren.

21:12.880 --> 21:14.110
Yiren!

21:30.920 --> 21:32.320
I'll remember your words

21:33.480 --> 21:35.010
and complete your mission.

21:36.270 --> 21:37.920
Rest in peace, Yiren.

21:47.270 --> 21:49.270
Help me take care of Yiren's burial.

22:46.750 --> 22:49.270
We have no interest in
the Xiao family's affairs.

22:49.270 --> 22:50.680
As for the position of
the Martial Arts Alliance Leader,

22:50.680 --> 22:51.550
I'll take it.

22:52.310 --> 22:55.310
You think the martial world
really has no heroes left?

22:58.680 --> 23:01.550
Here, aside from Elder Qiu, is there
anyone else worth mentioning?

23:01.550 --> 23:04.310
This monk and Taoist barely count as half.

23:04.790 --> 23:06.120
Who else is even notable

23:06.240 --> 23:08.240
from the so-called righteous sect?

23:08.510 --> 23:10.200
Ji Wupeng!

23:35.920 --> 23:38.250
So, do I count as part of
the righteous sect

23:38.310 --> 23:39.790
or the underworld?

23:41.070 --> 23:42.750
How would I know what you are?

23:43.310 --> 23:44.240
State your name!

23:56.310 --> 23:57.040
Big Brother!

24:12.270 --> 24:15.270
Ji Wupeng!

24:26.510 --> 24:28.240
No one has called me by the name

24:28.240 --> 24:31.000
"Ji Wupeng of the Nine Yang Shadow Hand"
for 30 years.

24:31.000 --> 24:32.240
Who exactly are you?

24:33.680 --> 24:34.940
How do you know my name?

24:45.830 --> 24:47.750
Ji Wupeng!

25:03.070 --> 25:04.640
Such powerful internal energy.

25:04.640 --> 25:05.640
Who is he?

25:06.000 --> 25:08.110
I can't believe someone like this
exists in the world.

25:08.110 --> 25:10.350
Those skills... He's definitely not here
with good intentions.

25:10.350 --> 25:12.480
This person feels somewhat familiar.

25:19.750 --> 25:20.240
You...

25:21.070 --> 25:22.160
You're Crazy Yan?

25:24.310 --> 25:25.400
He's still alive?

25:30.830 --> 25:31.880
Crazy Yan isn't dead?

25:31.880 --> 25:33.110
It really is Crazy Yan,

25:33.110 --> 25:34.440
and he's still so young.

25:34.720 --> 25:35.480
Exactly!

25:35.830 --> 25:36.720
This can't be right.

25:36.720 --> 25:37.680
After all these years,

25:37.680 --> 25:38.680
he hasn't aged at all.

25:38.680 --> 25:40.030
He's become even younger
and more formidable.

25:40.030 --> 25:41.430
This doesn't make sense.

25:41.510 --> 25:42.310
I knew it.

25:42.310 --> 25:44.830
With skills like that,
he's definitely no ordinary person.

25:44.830 --> 25:47.830
Back then, I didn't take part in
the ambush against you

25:48.110 --> 25:50.830
because I felt that
you roamed the martial world with pride,

25:50.830 --> 25:52.490
disregarding everyone else,

25:53.070 --> 25:56.110
a spirit somewhat akin to my own.

25:56.590 --> 25:57.920
But now that you've come,

25:57.920 --> 25:59.250
what is it that you seek?

26:04.680 --> 26:05.940
Since you know who I am,

26:07.000 --> 26:08.440
who else but me deserves

26:10.310 --> 26:11.920
the Hero Command Token?

26:16.160 --> 26:17.360
You don't deserve it.

26:24.510 --> 26:26.970
It's been many years
without any news of him.

26:50.030 --> 26:50.760
Big Brother!

26:51.240 --> 26:52.030
Stay back!

26:55.510 --> 26:56.680
For decades,

26:57.240 --> 26:59.440
no one has dared to speak to me like that.

27:00.310 --> 27:00.960
Kid,

27:01.830 --> 27:02.880
what's your name?

27:03.920 --> 27:04.790
Xiao Qiushui.

27:05.720 --> 27:07.790
Do you know who I, Crazy Yan, am?

27:08.750 --> 27:10.750
The top fighter in the martial world.

27:10.750 --> 27:12.880
So as the top fighter
in the martial world,

27:12.880 --> 27:15.140
am I not worthy of the Hero Command Token?

27:16.310 --> 27:17.160
You're not.

27:18.510 --> 27:19.400
I'm not?

27:22.440 --> 27:23.960
If I'm not, then who is?

27:24.960 --> 27:27.360
Only the top fighter
in the entire world is.

27:28.920 --> 27:31.310
Then who deserves to be the top fighter
in the entire world?

27:31.310 --> 27:32.430
General Wu Jie.

27:40.160 --> 27:41.070
Fair enough.

27:43.400 --> 27:45.260
But when it comes to martial arts,

27:45.440 --> 27:47.440
I'm invincible in the entire world.

27:48.030 --> 27:49.890
The truly invincible never kill.

27:50.680 --> 27:52.480
The benevolent are invincible.

27:53.070 --> 27:54.830
The lifeblood of the martial world

27:54.830 --> 27:56.640
can only be sustained
through righteousness,

27:56.640 --> 27:58.500
and only then can it be preserved.

27:58.640 --> 28:00.170
Just with your empty words?

28:01.720 --> 28:02.520
You're wrong.

28:03.240 --> 28:06.100
It's based on the four words,
"Heroes of the World."

28:07.880 --> 28:08.480
Very well.

28:09.510 --> 28:11.570
At least I've learned something new.

28:12.000 --> 28:13.400
After all these decades,

28:14.030 --> 28:17.160
the martial world has finally seen
someone remarkable.

28:18.200 --> 28:18.830
However,

28:19.510 --> 28:20.710
to conquer the world,

28:21.160 --> 28:22.360
you need real skills.

28:22.830 --> 28:24.200
If I wanted to kill you today,

28:24.200 --> 28:25.530
it would be effortless.

28:26.110 --> 28:27.440
But you have potential.

28:28.200 --> 28:31.880
I might as well take you as my disciple
and teach you martial skills.

28:31.880 --> 28:33.790
So why don't you kneel and kowtow to me

28:33.790 --> 28:35.350
while I'm in a good mood?

28:37.350 --> 28:38.070
I won't.

28:43.640 --> 28:46.300
Do you know how many martial artists
in the world

28:46.640 --> 28:48.350
would do anything just to have me

28:48.350 --> 28:50.480
teach them a single move or technique?

28:51.000 --> 28:53.920
Yet you dare decline my offer?

29:00.920 --> 29:02.400
Crazy Yan is arrogant

29:02.510 --> 29:03.640
and extreme in his actions.

29:03.640 --> 29:05.310
If he sets his sights on Big Brother,

29:05.310 --> 29:07.830
I'm afraid he won't stop
until he gets what he wants.

29:07.830 --> 29:08.830
What should we do?

29:18.680 --> 29:21.790
Are my martial skills not good enough?

29:22.550 --> 29:23.160
No.

29:25.920 --> 29:27.030
Then why is it?

29:30.590 --> 29:34.520
I kneel only to Heaven and Earth,
to my ruler, my parents, and my master,

29:34.680 --> 29:36.160
and to sages and heroes.

29:39.270 --> 29:41.070
But you're nothing but a madman.

29:42.240 --> 29:42.840
Well said.

29:44.030 --> 29:45.310
A madman, huh?

29:46.720 --> 29:47.720
I'd like to see

29:48.920 --> 29:51.960
whether you'll kneel or not.

29:59.110 --> 30:00.770
The Ananda Finger Technique?

30:07.110 --> 30:09.070
Shaolin's Hundred-Precept Misstep!

30:09.070 --> 30:11.510
Even someone who devotes their entire life
to Buddhism can hardly grasp

30:11.510 --> 30:14.030
the profound mystery
of this finger technique,

30:14.030 --> 30:16.830
yet Crazy Yan wields it
with such ease and mastery.

30:22.750 --> 30:25.150
The Jade Vessel Water-Pouring Technique.

30:32.720 --> 30:34.250
What a pathetic imitation.

32:20.510 --> 32:21.030
Kid,

32:21.680 --> 32:24.140
where did you steal
so many techniques from?

32:40.920 --> 32:42.380
I'd rather die than kneel!

32:42.790 --> 32:43.920
With your injuries,

32:43.920 --> 32:45.110
stop trying to be a hero.

32:45.110 --> 32:45.750
Kneel!

32:48.720 --> 32:49.450
Big Brother!

33:02.790 --> 33:05.050
Even if you don't want to kneel, you will.

33:07.030 --> 33:08.830
I said I won't kneel, and I won't!

34:03.720 --> 34:06.380
Refusing the easy way
and choosing the hard way?

34:38.320 --> 34:40.320
It's the Xuantian Blacksteel Palm!

34:44.320 --> 34:46.320
Hah, you really are a born tough one.

34:46.320 --> 34:48.250
Fine then, you don't have to kneel.

34:49.710 --> 34:50.670
Even if you kneel,

34:50.670 --> 34:52.270
I wouldn't be able to take it.

35:01.760 --> 35:03.110
The Xuantian Blacksteel Palm

35:03.110 --> 35:04.150
can kill!

35:04.440 --> 35:05.190
-Big Brother!
-Fifth Thug!

35:05.190 --> 35:07.590
-Mr. Xiao!
-Mr. Xiao!

35:13.070 --> 35:14.920
You're quite popular, kid.

35:14.920 --> 35:17.320
They're all willing to come help you.

35:17.670 --> 35:18.320
Fine then!

36:23.880 --> 36:26.080
I won't waste time on these dull vermin.

36:27.840 --> 36:29.100
I'll come back for you.

36:38.110 --> 36:39.040
Don't chase him!

36:46.920 --> 36:48.450
-Big Brother!
-Fifth Thug!

36:48.670 --> 36:49.510
-Mr. Xiao!
-Mr. Xiao!

36:49.510 --> 36:50.910
-Big Brother!
-Mr. Xiao!

36:51.110 --> 36:51.760
Mr. Xiao!

36:53.840 --> 36:54.880
Amitabha.

36:55.590 --> 36:57.510
Mr. Xiao, how are your injuries?

36:59.840 --> 37:00.480
I'm okay.

37:01.070 --> 37:03.400
Why did you stop us
from chasing Crazy Yan?

37:05.360 --> 37:06.510
Just now, Crazy Yan

37:07.710 --> 37:09.590
deliberately took a strike from me.

37:09.590 --> 37:10.760
Otherwise,

37:11.670 --> 37:13.070
I would have surely died.

37:13.920 --> 37:15.580
If he had wanted to kill us all,

37:16.840 --> 37:18.110
none of us here

37:19.550 --> 37:21.280
would have been a match for him.

37:25.110 --> 37:27.360
The winner of

37:28.480 --> 37:30.110
today's Martial Arts Alliance Leader
competition is:

37:30.110 --> 37:32.840
Xiao Qiushui
of the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

37:33.880 --> 37:35.190
Congratulations, Mr. Xiao.

37:35.190 --> 37:36.280
Congratulations, Mr. Xiao!

37:36.280 --> 37:37.880
Congratulations, Mr. Xiao.

37:38.110 --> 37:39.110
That's wonderful! Congratulations!

37:39.110 --> 37:41.920
Fifth Thug! Fifth Thug!

37:41.920 --> 37:42.800
Mr. Xiao.

37:43.360 --> 37:45.160
The martial world is in turmoil,

37:45.280 --> 37:47.280
and our state is on the edge of peril.

37:47.440 --> 37:48.700
From this day forward,

37:48.920 --> 37:50.710
you must bear this great responsibility,

37:50.710 --> 37:52.370
leading the martial alliance

37:54.440 --> 37:56.510
to fight together against our foes.

38:02.670 --> 38:03.710
-Big Brother.
-Fifth Thug.

38:03.710 --> 38:04.370
Fifth Thug!

38:04.440 --> 38:05.030
Take it, Fifth Thug.

38:05.030 --> 38:05.670
Take it.

38:15.920 --> 38:16.590
Take it.

38:36.920 --> 38:38.400
Crazy Yan, you cheated!

38:39.030 --> 38:39.890
Little rascal.

38:40.320 --> 38:41.840
The position of Alliance Leader is yours,

38:41.840 --> 38:44.700
but I have to take
the Hero Command Token for a while.

38:46.320 --> 38:48.440
-Big Brother!
-Mr. Xiao!

39:09.670 --> 39:10.320
Yiren.

39:12.880 --> 39:15.080
I still have so many things to say to you,

39:17.190 --> 39:18.790
but you can no longer hear me.

39:22.110 --> 39:24.640
In the past,
you were always burdened by fame.

39:26.510 --> 39:29.040
From now on,
the troubles of the martial world

39:30.320 --> 39:32.320
will no longer concern either of us.

39:35.110 --> 39:39.510
I'll take your sword
to travel across the land

39:41.760 --> 39:44.070
and seek a place of peace for the heart.

40:52.960 --> 40:55.420
How dare you impersonate
Zhu the Great King!

40:55.550 --> 40:58.150
The Heavenly King
must have been killed by him!

41:01.320 --> 41:02.580
Why are you all silent?

41:03.320 --> 41:03.840
This...

41:07.280 --> 41:08.680
Don't you want to kill me?

41:09.320 --> 41:10.050
Come on then.

41:10.480 --> 41:12.010
I'll fight you to the death!

41:29.110 --> 41:30.320
Anyone else?

41:35.670 --> 41:37.920
Then raise your heads and see clearly

41:38.840 --> 41:41.030
who your Heavenly King really is.
